### Obtener tarea
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Accept: application/json

### Actualizar tarea
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "done"
}

### Estado inválido: 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "invalido"
}

### Campo no permitido: 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerId": "000000000000000000000000"
}

### Eliminar tarea: 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{id}}
